# oneloopsol.com
# Created in cooperation with ChatGPT, unedited by me
#
# Intent is a brand independent script for laptops with keyboard backlight
# Turns off the backlight after 20 seconds (change parameter in script, then run install)
# Turns backlight automatically back on, on any keypress
#
# Not tested that much, but it works for me
# I immediately like it

# Usage:

chmod +x auto-kbd-backlight
./auto-kbd-backlight
